# Example environment variables — copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# This file is NOT exhaustive: it documents optional integrations that are easy to miss.
# The full, authoritative list of environment variables lives in CLAUDE.md
# ("Environment Variables" section).

# ── Langfuse (LLM observability + evals) ───────────────────────────────────
# The single, governed LLM-observability standard (see docs/adr/0001-llm-observability
# -langfuse.md). Two uses from the same keys:
#   1. Production tracing of LangChain/LangGraph runs — the IG support agent + classifier,
#      the chat agent, and SMS strategist generation (tickets/services/ai_tracing.py).
#   2. Hosted eval datasets + experiment runs for `python manage.py eval_ig_agent`.
# Unset = no traces are sent and the eval command errors cleanly (zero overhead).
# PII NOTE: traces include prompts + tool results (e.g. customer DM content). Point
# LANGFUSE_HOST at a SELF-HOSTED instance inside your own boundary when that data must
# not leave the box, rather than the default cloud endpoint.
LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk-lf-your_key_here
LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=sk-lf-your_key_here
LANGFUSE_HOST=https://cloud.langfuse.com
# The org the eval answers as (seed_local_data sets this for you):
# IG_EVAL_ORG_SLUG=familiar-faces
